  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.2.0 stable: Version-sync with SpawnDev.WebTorrent + SpawnDev.WebTorrent.Server 3.2.0. No source changes in WebTorrent.Server.HuggingFace itself. The HuggingFace proxy continues to serve model files from HuggingFace's CDN with local caching, automatic torrent generation, and per-model stats. See SpawnDev.WebTorrent 3.2.0 release notes for the underlying client / server changes (TCP listener tracker advertising, pluggable IPieceHashEngine, BandwidthPolicy enum, SipSorcery fork StreamStatus public setter).",
